  "default/31742.htm": {
   "file": "default/31742.htm",
   "quest": null,
   "text": "Virgil: Hey, young man! Would you like to hear an old trader's story? I devoted my entire life to making a profit. Now I'm one of the wealthiest Dwarves ever! My fortune will support my family for generations to come! My wealth is truly great! But no matter how much money I make, the emptiness I've…",
