   "quest": 241,
   "text": "Virgil: My granddaughter Kassandra suffers from a grave illness. She was always weak, but her nightmares are robbing her of what little strength she has left. She was born with a special gift to foresee the future in her dreams. Ogmar thinks you might be able to help, so I asked you to come. He kno…",
